442 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (In human biology, millions of sperms are released at ejaculation, the first to make it to ovum fertilizes it while the rest die. The one in a million sperm that made it grows to become a living being who later manufactures jet engines, designs complex computer systems, builds skyscrapers and oversees multinational conglomerates. The greatness of human life is not in the million that died but the one that made it. Similarly, no matter how many ideas were conceived and aborted in the womb of your mind, there is still sufficient space and time for success in the one idea that you will conceive and execute now irrespective of the past. You can still be a success as long as you have not become barren of ideas and you make a new resolution to follow through on your ideas. )
/E (In human biology, millions of sperms are released at ejaculation, the first to make it to ovum fertilizes it while the rest die. The one in a million sperm that made it grows to become a living being who later manufactures jet engines, designs complex computer systems, builds skyscrapers and oversees multinational conglomerates. The greatness of human life is not in the million that died but the one that made it. Similarly, no matter how many ideas were conceived and aborted in the womb of your mind, there is still sufficient space and time for success in the one idea that you will conceive and execute now irrespective of the past. You can still be a success as long as you have not become barren of ideas and you make a new resolution to follow through on your ideas. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
