455 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (It is amazing that we take an inventory of our lives, we take stock of our real estate, cars, gadgets, clothing, certificates and material possession as our esteemed assets while forgetting to reckon our most valuable assets - our ideas and our inherent abilities. )
/E (It is amazing that we take an inventory of our lives, we take stock of our real estate, cars, gadgets, clothing, certificates and material possession as our esteemed assets while forgetting to reckon our most valuable assets - our ideas and our inherent abilities. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
