458 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Great people are those who follow through on ideas to the reality stage. The following are steps to take in translating ideas to reality. )
/E (Great people are those who follow through on ideas to the reality stage. The following are steps to take in translating ideas to reality. )
/Pg 20 0 R
