459 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 980 0 R
/ActualText (Conceive the Ideas: You must master the art of conceiving ideas. Solitude is an art of royalty; when it comes to conception and gestating ideas. Meditation and observation are instruments for generating ideas. Divine ideas come as revelation into spirit. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
