462 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 981 0 R
/ActualText (Write the Ideas: Writing is a royal behavior. If it is said that readers are leaders, then what should be said of the ones that write what is read. Writers are the leaders and influencers of leaders. Writing is a divine attribute. God instructed many men in the Bible to write down what they see. \(Ex. 17: 14, Jer. 36: 2, Hab. 2:2, Rev. 1: 19\). Ideas are worth so little unless they are caught on paper and ink. Very powerful ideas could be so fleeting that if not timely captured, they will pass away with all the great benefit inherent in them. Have an ideas room where you meditate, have an ideas book where you write down your ideas.  )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
463 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 982 0 R
/ActualText (Develop the Ideas: Idea development starts with the writing phase, as writing forces one to think constructively and articulately. However, writing is not all there is to idea development. Research, consultation and analysis are part of developing ideas. There is need to study cases of successful executions of related ideas, share the ideas with positive minded individual and organize vision-casting and brain-storming sessions, pitch your ideas to stakeholders. Do you now see why people usually do not pursue their ideas, developing an idea is already tedious enough a job, how much more the strenuous work of execution. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
