/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 987 0 R
/ActualText (Prepare for Opportunities: Life was designed to reward preparation and penalise unpreparedness. The first thing to do in positioning for any form of success is preparation. Preparation entails developing character and building capacity for success, putting systems in place, acquiring necessary training, skills and certifications, developing necessary relationships as well as saving and investing financially for the day of opportunity. When you think you have prepared and opportunity has not shown up, it means you have been given more opportunity to prepare for opportunity. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
