497 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Preparation is not contrary to faith; in fact, the prove that you are in faith is that you are diligently preparing. The only right use of today is to use it to prepare for tomorrow. The quality of your life today is a reflection of your preparations of yesterday. The quality of your tomorrow will be a reflection of your preparation of today.  A person not preparing but waiting and hoping is wasting. While waiting for opportunities, use the time actively to prepare, position, build capacity, align self and put structures in place while anticipating the door of opportunity to open.)
/E (Preparation is not contrary to faith; in fact, the prove that you are in faith is that you are diligently preparing. The only right use of today is to use it to prepare for tomorrow. The quality of your life today is a reflection of your preparations of yesterday. The quality of your tomorrow will be a reflection of your preparation of today.  A person not preparing but waiting and hoping is wasting. While waiting for opportunities, use the time actively to prepare, position, build capacity, align self and put structures in place while anticipating the door of opportunity to open.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
