498 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (2. Seek Opportunities: Another thing to do with opportunities is to seek for them. Opportunity, many times, does not just come to people, it has to be sought out. In the quest for opportunities, after adequate preparation, another vital step is to start the search. Opportunity searching is both a spiritual and a physical exertion. Therefore, in the pursuit of success, preparing, scouting as well as praying for opportunities is a necessity. Prayer, should not be limited to being a vehicle of asking for material things, it must be rightly engaged as a tool for receiving and developing intangible blessings - ideas and opportunities, among many others. )
/E (2. Seek Opportunities: Another thing to do with opportunities is to seek for them. Opportunity, many times, does not just come to people, it has to be sought out. In the quest for opportunities, after adequate preparation, another vital step is to start the search. Opportunity searching is both a spiritual and a physical exertion. Therefore, in the pursuit of success, preparing, scouting as well as praying for opportunities is a necessity. Prayer, should not be limited to being a vehicle of asking for material things, it must be rightly engaged as a tool for receiving and developing intangible blessings - ideas and opportunities, among many others. )
/Pg 26 0 R
