/T (3. Create Opportunities: There are times when you seek opportunities and you find none, so you create opportunities for yourselves. You can create opportunities by creating a demand or need for what you can do, creating awareness of your capacities and potentials, creating new relationships and meeting people. In the story of Joseph before the Pharaoh of Egypt told earlier, Joseph actually used the opportunity to create an appointment need for himself. Quit begging people for jobs or contracts, create opportunity for yourself by identifying a problem, solving it even if you have to do it free foremost for them to see the value it will bring to them.)
/E (3. Create Opportunities: There are times when you seek opportunities and you find none, so you create opportunities for yourselves. You can create opportunities by creating a demand or need for what you can do, creating awareness of your capacities and potentials, creating new relationships and meeting people. In the story of Joseph before the Pharaoh of Egypt told earlier, Joseph actually used the opportunity to create an appointment need for himself. Quit begging people for jobs or contracts, create opportunity for yourself by identifying a problem, solving it even if you have to do it free foremost for them to see the value it will bring to them.)
