/T (Additionally, in Matt 14: 14 - 21, when Jesus Christ wanted to feed five thousand men with many women and children, He needed to perform a miracle of multiplication. However, the miracle still started with using something someone among them had. One person presented some little pieces of bread and fish he had, God performed a miracle and multiplied them.)
