539 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Even if God wants to give you a miracle, there will still be a demand on something you have or do. Waiting for a miracle without deploying value is the reason many believers have been stagnated at the same point for years. Even if you received favour from someone who gave you something free without any demand on value from your end, you should know that the person engaged his/her value to get that which you were given. One can attain sustenance through charity but nobody attains success receiving hands-out. Value and productivity is always the way to sustainable success - Ask for testimonies from the people who give the charity, not the people who receive them. )
/E (Even if God wants to give you a miracle, there will still be a demand on something you have or do. Waiting for a miracle without deploying value is the reason many believers have been stagnated at the same point for years. Even if you received favour from someone who gave you something free without any demand on value from your end, you should know that the person engaged his/her value to get that which you were given. One can attain sustenance through charity but nobody attains success receiving hands-out. Value and productivity is always the way to sustainable success - Ask for testimonies from the people who give the charity, not the people who receive them. )
