<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (While people are seeking externally for someone or something to make them successful, genuine and lasting success only flows from inside out. In the quest for success, success is elusive when people seek it only externally. All profitable search for success begins internally. What will make you successful is inherent to you and is waiting to be discovered and unleashed. )
/E (While people are seeking externally for someone or something to make them successful, genuine and lasting success only flows from inside out. In the quest for success, success is elusive when people seek it only externally. All profitable search for success begins internally. What will make you successful is inherent to you and is waiting to be discovered and unleashed. )
