548 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (It is great wisdom to invest first into intrinsic value before extrinsic. To have sustainable success, it is also advisable to invest more into intrinsic value than extrinsic. Even though, extrinsic possessions are usually more glamorous and celebrated, people who understand the power of delayed gratification develop intrinsic value first. The truly successful are not in a hurry to look good, rather they are willing to build lasting success by first taking ample time to develop intrinsic capacity. )
/E (It is great wisdom to invest first into intrinsic value before extrinsic. To have sustainable success, it is also advisable to invest more into intrinsic value than extrinsic. Even though, extrinsic possessions are usually more glamorous and celebrated, people who understand the power of delayed gratification develop intrinsic value first. The truly successful are not in a hurry to look good, rather they are willing to build lasting success by first taking ample time to develop intrinsic capacity. )
