557 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Life success is primarily measured in terms of the output one generates and not the capacity one possess. There are few things more frustrating than having input but no output. Nothing more agonizing than to be knowledgeable but broke, learned but failed, capacious but mediocre. Productivity is the bridge between being full of potential and being full of results. )
/E (Life success is primarily measured in terms of the output one generates and not the capacity one possess. There are few things more frustrating than having input but no output. Nothing more agonizing than to be knowledgeable but broke, learned but failed, capacious but mediocre. Productivity is the bridge between being full of potential and being full of results. )
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
558 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Productivity is the ability to create, make and enhance product and services that meet human and societal needs, it involves serving out the products and services in excellence as well as creating a medium for flow of returns to you. Productivity involves the ability to make whatever you have or do more abundant and expansive. A productive person always has profitable things to do. )
