/T (In candid words, one of the greatest injustice you probably have been doing to your value, is that you have been under-pricing, underselling or have been giving it free for too long. This might be a reason you do not have resources to re-invest into developing it and also build a good life of success for your self. Value only multiplies when it is rewarded. If there is no reward, which could be material or intangible, value is eventually frustrated into demise. This is the reason, God is an ardent believer in rewarding people for value and inputs. According to Heb 11:6, He who comes to God must believe that He is, and that He is a rewarder of those who diligently seek Him. )
