<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In the school of leadership, greatness and success, the greatest asset one can have is a strong character. Therefore, in attaining and sustaining success, a wise area of personal investment is character development. Character is having a strong personality, moral rectitude and life disposition that is consistent with the highest values. Character is the value, virtue and fortitude to be non-compromising in the face of wrong alternatives and the ability to consistently live by highest standards even when they are not convenient.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [1]
