/T (It is the emotions and perceptions that come up whenever your name is mentioned. In business, family, corporate leadership or as an organisation, your reputation goes ahead of you and determines what comes to you. Therefore, scripture says, it is important to choose a good reputation over great riches; being held in high esteem is better than silver or gold.)
/E (It is the emotions and perceptions that come up whenever your name is mentioned. In business, family, corporate leadership or as an organisation, your reputation goes ahead of you and determines what comes to you. Therefore, scripture says, it is important to choose a good reputation over great riches; being held in high esteem is better than silver or gold.)
