/T (Corruption, failed families, inadequate resources, global pollution, suicide, recession and economic hardship, fraudulence and a lot more problems today are because some people bent the rules some times back to attain some seeming success. The truth about success is that it can only be measured trans-generationally and eternally. Any success attained that put future generations in jeopardy is failure. A person who lived and acquired much but future generations later looked back and cursed his memory actually failed. It is true that success without a successor is failure and it is also true that success at the expense of future generations is failure. A father is who acquired material success but became the reason his children and future generations will bear an evil name failed. )
