/S /H2
/T (Have you ever given it a thought that every plant worthwhile needs to be planted and cultivated while weeds grow easily on their own? Similarly, a garden of flower only comes out perfect when carefully tended and nurtured by someone. However, when left to itself, it becomes overgrown with thorns and weeds. Hence, nothing left to chance ever comes out well. You must live intentionally; do not leave your life to chance. If you leave things to chance, they stand every chance of going wrong.)
/E (Have you ever given it a thought that every plant worthwhile needs to be planted and cultivated while weeds grow easily on their own? Similarly, a garden of flower only comes out perfect when carefully tended and nurtured by someone. However, when left to itself, it becomes overgrown with thorns and weeds. Hence, nothing left to chance ever comes out well. You must live intentionally; do not leave your life to chance. If you leave things to chance, they stand every chance of going wrong.)
