/S /H2
/T (Similarly, character development and building the right attributes and attitudes for success will never happen by chance. You need to work contentiously at it. It takes consistent discipline, regimented routines and constant practices to develop great traits and a winning lifestyle. While bad habits and poor practices that lead to mediocrity and failure seem to come more naturally, the attitudes that make for success need to be developed. Self-indulgence is the natural inclination of most humans while self-mastery takes effort. Self-mastery is the seed for a harvest of quality character. Character is one major seed for a harvest of success.)
/E (Similarly, character development and building the right attributes and attitudes for success will never happen by chance. You need to work contentiously at it. It takes consistent discipline, regimented routines and constant practices to develop great traits and a winning lifestyle. While bad habits and poor practices that lead to mediocrity and failure seem to come more naturally, the attitudes that make for success need to be developed. Self-indulgence is the natural inclination of most humans while self-mastery takes effort. Self-mastery is the seed for a harvest of quality character. Character is one major seed for a harvest of success.)
