729 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (We are either relating with people above us, people at our level or people below us. It is humility to know that someone is above us in certain areas of life. It is equally not pride to know that someone is below us. However, whether someone is above, below or at the same level with us in life, we must relate with them in humility and accord them honour. According to 1 Peter 2:17, honor all people. love the brotherhood \(the Christian family of believers\). Fear God. Honor the king. We must treat all people with honour and respect whether they are above, below or at our level. )
/E (We are either relating with people above us, people at our level or people below us. It is humility to know that someone is above us in certain areas of life. It is equally not pride to know that someone is below us. However, whether someone is above, below or at the same level with us in life, we must relate with them in humility and accord them honour. According to 1 Peter 2:17, honor all people. love the brotherhood \(the Christian family of believers\). Fear God. Honor the king. We must treat all people with honour and respect whether they are above, below or at our level. )
/Pg 60 0 R
/K [0]
>>
