755 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Fellow: Fellows are people who are for what you are also for. They are with you because of a common course that join you both together. Fellows are vital parts of your success and are great assets to you so you must value and give your best to them. However, fellows are not loyal to you, they are loyal to the mutual course you all pursue. Therefore, you cannot commit your life to Fellows. Fellows are not to be your life confidants and personal secrets are not for them. There are not interested in you, they are interested in what you are interested in. When dealing with Fellows, you need to wisely guard your personal interest so that you will not eventually be at the losing end of life. )
/E (Fellow: Fellows are people who are for what you are also for. They are with you because of a common course that join you both together. Fellows are vital parts of your success and are great assets to you so you must value and give your best to them. However, fellows are not loyal to you, they are loyal to the mutual course you all pursue. Therefore, you cannot commit your life to Fellows. Fellows are not to be your life confidants and personal secrets are not for them. There are not interested in you, they are interested in what you are interested in. When dealing with Fellows, you need to wisely guard your personal interest so that you will not eventually be at the losing end of life. )
