780 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (determined by the perceived level of the person to the relationship with you and not your perceived level of relationship with the person. Therefore, be a master at letting people dictate where they stand with you.)
/E (determined by the perceived level of the person to the relationship with you and not your perceived level of relationship with the person. Therefore, be a master at letting people dictate where they stand with you.)
/Pg 68 0 R
