/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (There are essential resources for actualising one's purpose and potential in life. Wisdom is principal among these essentials. Wisdom entails knowing the 'What', 'When', 'How', 'Where' and 'With Whom' of every action in life. Thus, Wisdom for Living is knowing the right thing\(s\) to do, the right time to do it, the right place/environment, the right approach/method, as well as the right relationships/associations to do it with in order to have a fulfilled life.)
/E (There are essential resources for actualising one's purpose and potential in life. Wisdom is principal among these essentials. Wisdom entails knowing the 'What', 'When', 'How', 'Where' and 'With Whom' of every action in life. Thus, Wisdom for Living is knowing the right thing\(s\) to do, the right time to do it, the right place/environment, the right approach/method, as well as the right relationships/associations to do it with in order to have a fulfilled life.)
/Pg 75 0 R
/K [6]
